// A 1-hour warded boundary, not a one-shot burst -- corrected from the
// sheet's own `GroundAoe` tag to `StaticAura`, the same variant correction
// this school's Wave-1 batch already made for entangle.ron/fog_cloud.ron/
// grease.ron: `GroundAoe` resolves a single strike (damage/poise/knockback
// or a `pooled_debuff`) once at cast and has no standalone lingering-zone
// entity or `aura_duration` field, so it cannot express a boundary that goes
// on reapplying its effect to anyone who crosses it for a full hour.
// `StaticAura` (plant_growth.ron's own precedent for a left-behind zone
// entity) is the real fit. D&D's "repels/hinders a chosen creature type,
// invertible to trap them instead" has no creature-kind-conditional
// targeting or invert-the-boundary primitive, so it ships as a flat
// `DifficultTerrain` zone against `OutOfGroup` targets (the caster's own
// allies pass through freely) -- "hindering any that try to cross the
// boundary" is the one half of the sheet's own effect this maps onto
// directly.
StaticAura(
    buildup_duration: 0.5,
    cast_duration: 0.4,
    recover_duration: 0.4,
    energy_cost: 50.0,
    targets: OutOfGroup,
    auras: [
        (
            kind: DifficultTerrain,
            strength: 0.5,
            duration: Some(2.0),
            category: Some(Magical),
        ),
    ],
    aura_duration: Some(3600.0),
    range: 3.0,
    sprite_info: None,
    meta: (school: Some(Abjuration), source: Some(Divine)),
)
